arina Beach","description":"Pondi Marina Beach is a vibrant coastal hub in Puducherry known for its scenic beauty and diverse activities, including relaxing, water sports, and cultural experiences. It features a long, scenic stretch of beach, food stalls, and attractions like horse and camel rides. Visitors can enjoy stunning sunsets, take boat rides from the nearby boat house, and find both vibrant markets and relaxing spots for quiet contemplation.","visitTime":"05:03 PM - 05:33 PM","duration":"30 Min","amount":null,"timings":"Open 24 Hours","image":"/uploads/hotspot_gallery/b8SfHsxE3gu4.jpg","galleryImages":["/uploads/hotspot_gallery/b8SfHsxE3gu4.jpg"],"videoUrl":"https://youtu.be/6Z6oZZHvYIk?si=t1WbgLx8AnDE9Bh8","planOwnWay":false,"activities":[],"hasAvailableActivities":false,"hotspotId":679,"routeHotspotId":124149,"locationId":6651,"priority":9999,"isConflict":false,"conflictReason":null,"isManual":false,"isDeleted":false},{"type":"hotspot","text":"Click to Add Hotspot","locationId":6651,"anchorType":"after_travel","anchorIndex":6,"anchorFrom":"Pondi Marina Beach","anchorTo":"The Basilica of the Sacred Heart of Jesus","anchorTimeRange":"05:33 PM - 05:42 PM"},{"type":"travel","from":"Pondi Marina Beach","to":"The Basilica of the Sacred Heart of Jesus","timeRange":"05:33 PM - 05:42 PM","distance":"2.20 KM","duration":"9 Min","note":"This may vary due to traffic conditions","isConflict":false,"conflictReason":null},{"type":"attraction","name":"The Basilica of the Sacred Heart of Jesus","description":"Synopsis. This church is one of the best examples of Gothic architecture in India. A revered pilgrimage spot, it is quite famous for its brilliant stained glass panels depicting incidents from Christ&#039;s life. A century-old structure, it is house to 28 glass pictures of saints who were related to the church.","visitTime":"05:42 PM - 06:12 PM","duration":"30 Min","amount":null,"timings":"06:00 AM - 07:00 PM","image":"/uploads/hotspot_gallery/The_Basilica_of_the_Sac